window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b><i>Welcome to Inferno, the city where monsters rule and only the strong survive. Each district is ruled by a different species: dragons, vampires, werewolves, mages, daemons, gargoyles, and fae.</i></b></p> <p>This omnibus follows three vampire Blood Lords as they fight to claim their Brides and their HEAs in a city with enemies around every corner and a thirst for power that can never be satisfied.</p> <p><i>Please note that this series contains violence, swearing, and spicy scenes.</i></p> <p>Contains mature themes.</p>"; 
